When an Altergeist is Link Summoned, 
I can add it to my hand!

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:29.410
I activate Altergeist Fijialert’s 
effect from my hand!

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:33.130
When an Altergeist Link Monster is Link Summoned,

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:35.650
I can Special Summon it next to General's link!

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:41.850
I'm going to use your card.

00:20:41.850 --> 00:20:44.090
Do whatever you want.

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:47.800
Fijialert’s effect!

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:52.060
I select one Link Monser and 
turn it into an Altergeist!

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:55.070
I select Warrant!

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:59.270
Then Pookuery’s effect from my hand!

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:05.240
When an Altergeist on the field is used to 
Link Summon, I can use this card to Link Summon!

00:21:05.580 --> 00:21:08.010
Open before me!

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:11.220
The circuit that connects to 
the unknown parallel universe!

00:21:12.180 --> 00:21:16.650
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Altergeists!

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:23.390
I set Pookuery, Fijialert and Link 
2 Warrant in the Link Markers!

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:29.600
The goddess of slaughter!  Manifest 
from the edge of nightmares!

00:21:29.960 --> 00:21:31.540
Link Summon!

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:35.250
Link 4 Altergeist Memorygant!

00:21:36.570 --> 00:21:38.880
Hexstia’s effect!

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:43.550
It gains the original ATK of the 
Altergeist next to its link!

00:21:43.550 --> 00:21:49.020
Hexstia gains Memorygant’s ATK.

00:21:52.740 --> 00:21:56.680
A monster that’s Link 4 and has 4300 ATK!

00:21:56.680 --> 00:21:59.960
So this is both of your abilities!

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:02.970
This is the bond that 
binds me with my brother!

00:22:02.970 --> 00:22:05.970
With this card, we’ll defeat you!

00:22:08.150 --> 00:22:12.120
I was told repeatedly

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:19.570
Only tales of dreams

00:22:19.920 --> 00:22:26.540
Is my life precious?

00:22:26.800 --> 00:22:29.510
Make up for  Make up for

00:22:29.900 --> 00:22:37.050
The next sentimental

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:48.300
I'm not a machine

00:22:51.020 --> 00:22:54.740
I cry a single tear

00:22:56.230 --> 00:22:59.940
A single answer moves me

00:23:01.130 --> 00:23:10.320
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:10.940 --> 00:23:15.750
Are you ready?

00:23:16.250 --> 00:23:21.100
Oh oh oh

00:23:21.620 --> 00:23:26.300
Are you ready?

00:23:26.920 --> 00:23:33.410
Are you ready?

00:23:40.100 --> 00:23:47.540
With their sibling bond, just when Ghost Gal 
and Blood Shepherd are about to end this...

00:23:47.540 --> 00:23:50.840
Ai finds Go Onizuka.

00:23:50.840 --> 00:23:55.420
Is this coincidence?  Or is it destiny?

00:23:55.420 --> 00:24:01.490
Since he's the reason Earth is 
gone, Ai won't let him escape!

